摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek account balance and session cost readout for the DeepSeek Harness Web GUI","id":"gh:1333443843","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-balance-meter","slug":"Ghost011118/dsh-balance-meter","topics":["balance","cost-tracking","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-web-ui","plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek account balance and session cost readout for the DeepSeek Harness Web GUI"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-balance-meter"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"DeepSeek account balance and session-cost readout for the DeepSeek Harness (DSH) Web GUI."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- Explicit balance sources: official API, proxy-compatible endpoint, or a\nmanual balance accounted a"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"nd persisted locally\n- Current session estimated spend (token usage x official pricing)\n- Per-model "},{"id":"p5s3","text":"pricing: reads the model actually driving each session from its\nrequest header (flash vs pro), so th"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"e cost tracks the model you used instead\nof a fixed default\n- Auto-fetches the official pricing page"},{"id":"p5s5","text":" every 6h, so price changes and the\n2026-08-17 peak/off-peak pricing rollout never require a plugin "},{"id":"p5s6","text":"update\n- Peak-hour band (Beijing 09:00-12:00 / 14:00-18:00) applied automatically\nonce the peak pric"},{"id":"p5s7","text":"-hour band (Beijing 09:00-12:00 / 14:00-18:00) applied automatically\nonce the peak pricing goes live"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"The composer dock shows a chip with the account total balance and the\ncurrent session's estimated co"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" composer dock shows a chip with the account total balance and the\ncurrent session's estimated cost:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Clicking the chip reveals the per-currency balance breakdown (granted +\ntop-up) and the per-bucket c"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ost breakdown (input / cache read / output).\nClicking while an error is shown forces an immediate re"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"eakdown (input / cache read / output).\nClicking while an error is shown forces an immediate refresh."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness `0.1.0-rc.6` or newer (web profile)\n- A DeepSeek API key stored through the DSH c"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"redentials seam\n(`DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` — the web Models page writes it)"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"From a git URL (no npm account needed):"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Or from a local checkout:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Restart `dsh web`, then refresh the page. The balance chip appears in the\ncomposer dock next to the "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"conversation stats line."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The plugin is zero-config by default (uses `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` and the\nofficial pricing page). Option"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"al composition settings:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Key | Type | Default | Meaning |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| `source` | `'official' \\| 'proxy' \\| 'manual'` | `official` | Provenance of the displayed balance."},{"id":"p22s2","text":" A legacy custom `baseUrl` with no source is automatically classified as `proxy` |\n| `balanceEndpoin"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"t` | `string` | `/user/balance` | Proxy balance path or absolute HTTP(S) URL |\n| `proxyBalancePath` "},{"id":"p22s4","text":"| `string` | unset | Dot path (for example `data.balance`) to a numeric balance when the proxy does "},{"id":"p22s5","text":"not return DeepSeek-compatible `balance_infos` |\n| `proxyCurrency` | `string` | `CNY` | Currency pai"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"red with `proxyBalancePath` |\n| `manualBalance` | `number >= 0` | unset | Current balance entered by"},{"id":"p22s7","text":" the user; changing it creates a new local accounting baseline |\n| `manualCurrency` | `string` | `CN"},{"id":"p22s8","text":"Y` | Currency of the manual balance |\n| `model` | `'auto' \\| 'flash' \\| 'pro'` | `auto` | `auto` det"},{"id":"p22s9","text":"ects each session's model from its request header (flash/pro); `flash`/`pro` force that preset regar"},{"id":"p22s10","text":"dless of auto-detection |\n| `pricingRefreshHours` | `number` | `6` | Hours between automatic officia"},{"id":"p22s11","text":"l-pricing refreshes |\n| `apiKeyEnv` | `string` | `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` | Credential ref storing the Dee"},{"id":"p22s12","text":"pSeek API key |\n| `baseUrl` | `string` | `https://api.deepseek.com` | API base URL (gateway/compat o"},{"id":"p22s13","text":"verride) |\n| `refreshIntervalSeconds` | `number` | `30` | Minimum seconds between balance queries |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### Proxy and manual modes"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"`proxy` mode keeps the API key on the DSH host and sends it only as a Bearer\ncredential to the confi"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"gured endpoint. A DeepSeek-compatible relay may return\n`balance_infos` directly. Other relays must c"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"onfigure `proxyBalancePath`; a\nmissing or non-numeric value is reported as a proxy error and is neve"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"r labelled\nas an official balance."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"`manual` mode requires a writable DSH settings provider. The hidden ledger is\nstored inside the exis"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ting `balance` settings namespace, not in a separate\nplaintext file and never in the browser respons"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"e. It records a baseline,\nremaining amount, locally charged spend, and per-session cumulative-token\n"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"checkpoints. Only positive token deltas after the last persisted checkpoint are\ncharged, so polling "},{"id":"p25s5","text":"or restarting DSH cannot deduct the same cumulative session\nusage twice. Changing `manualBalance` or"},{"id":"p25s6","text":" `manualCurrency` intentionally creates\na new baseline and checkpoints all currently live sessions."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## How the cost is estimated"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"The plugin reads DSH's durable `tokenUsage` projection (the same accounting\nthe built-in stats line "},{"id":"p27s2","text":"uses) and converts the four buckets — uncached\ninput, cache read, cache write, output — to money usi"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"ng prices parsed from\nthe official pricing page. Cache-write tokens are not billed separately by\nDee"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"pSeek and default to 0."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"For the price set, in `auto` mode (the default) it uses the model actually\ndriving the session: each"},{"id":"p28s2","text":" session's request header records the provider/model\nof the most recent request, and the plugin maps"},{"id":"p28s3","text":" that id (`deepseek-v4-flash`\n→ flash, `deepseek-v4-pro` → pro) to the matching per-million prices. "},{"id":"p28s4","text":"A\nsession is therefore priced at whatever model produced its usage, not a\nhard-coded flash. When no "},{"id":"p28s5","text":"header exists yet or the model id is unrecognized,\n`auto` falls back to flash. Setting `model: flash"},{"id":"p28s6","text":"` or `model: pro` explicitly\nforces that preset and ignores auto-detection, so you can pin the estim"},{"id":"p28s7","text":"ate to\none model when you want to."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Before the 2026-08-17 peak-pricing rollout the current single prices stay\nauthoritative; after it, t"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"he peak/off-peak band for the current Beijing hour\nis applied. If the pricing page cannot be fetched"},{"id":"p29s3","text":", built-in presets (flash:\n0.02 / 1 / 2 CNY per 1M) are used. Explicit `cost.*` overrides in the\ncom"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"position config take precedence over any preset. The cost JSON also\nreports `pricingKey` and `model`"},{"id":"p29s5","text":" so the chip can show which model was priced."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Troubleshooting"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"### \"no API key for provider route \\`deepseek-official\\`\""},{"id":"p32s1","text":"The host reads your key from the DSH credentials store — the file\n`<harness home>/.credentials.yaml`"},{"id":"p32s2","text":" (default `~/.dsh/.credentials.yaml`), the\nsame store the web **Models** page writes. This plugin's "},{"id":"p32s3","text":"balance query and the\nLLM route resolve through that same seam."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- If this error appears, make sure the document contains\n`DEEPSEEK_API_KEY: sk-...` (a strict mappin"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"g of reference to non-empty\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
